Limit HTTP/2 request-body scratch buffers to 32 KiB.
Based on the prizrak-http implementation used by Prizrak-Core:
https://github.com/legiz-ru/prizrak-http/commit/da5b4c1e0882

Apply the same cap to the bundled HTTP/2 client in h2_bundle.go and the
standalone client in http2/transport.go. Retain the peer frame-size and
request content-length bounds; this does not limit the total request size.
Include in-memory upload tests for both clients and large advertised frames.

